# The git refs of the other HuRI repositories this checkout of huri-modules is
# built and tested against. Shell-sourceable: KEY=value lines, no spaces around
# "=", comments allowed. A release tag ("0.4.0") on main; on dev, a tag or
# "dev". RELEASING.md says when each one moves.
#
# Readers: scripts/install_local.sh (install.sh), deploy/install_huri.sh and the
# Dockerfiles' build args, the CI workflows. The environment variables of the
# same names override this file for the installer, as do HURI_CORE_PATH /
# HURI_CLI_PATH (a local checkout, installed editable).

# huri-core: https://github.com/Lucy-Robotics/huri-core (the framework).
HURI_CORE_REF=0.4.0

# HuRI-CLI: https://github.com/Lucy-Robotics/HuRI-CLI (huri-cli, the reference client the
# installer adds; the Docker images do not carry it).
HURI_CLI_REF=0.1.0
